'''Miracle Performance''' (ミラクルライブ！, ''Mirakuru Raibu！'', '''Miracle Live!''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

==Effect==
"Critical" Rate UP (M): [[Critical Hit]] chance for all cats that have the ability is increased by 2%.

